<%# One deployment, told as an event rather than a table row (spec 08 / design M2).
    What it says, in order of what an operator actually needs:
      1. what happened + which release
      2. WHY, when we know — a failure that wasn't the app's code says so, because
         two of one week's failures here were Conductor's own bugs and reading them
         as app failures sends someone to debug the wrong system
      3. whether a human overrode the preflight gate (`forced`) — that is the single
         most important thing to be able to see afterwards
      4. who, and when

    NOT shown: whether a human or an agent triggered it. Conductor doesn't record that
    (no trigger/source column), and inventing an actor would be worse than omitting one. %>
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 border-b border-border last:border-b-0">
  <div class="flex items-start gap-3 min-w-0">
    <% icon, tone = case deployment.status
                    when "succeeded" then [ "✓", "bg-primary-tint text-primary" ]
                    when "failed"    then [ "✕", "bg-danger-tint text-danger-deep" ]
                    when "blocked"   then [ "⊘", "bg-warning-tint text-warning" ]
                    else                  [ "•", "bg-fill text-muted" ]
                    end %>
    <span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-card text-2xs font-semibold <%= tone %>">
      <%= icon %>
    </span>

    <div class="min-w-0">
      <div class="text-sm text-ink">
        <span class="font-medium"><%= activity_headline(deployment) %></span>
        <% if deployment.commit_sha.present? %>
          <code class="ml-1 rounded bg-fill px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-2xs text-body"><%= deployment.commit_sha.first(7) %></code>
        <% end %>
        <% if deployment.rollback? %>
          <span class="ml-1 text-2xs uppercase tracking-label text-muted">⤺ rollback</span>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <% if (why = activity_reason(deployment)) %>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-2xs text-muted"><%= why %></p>
      <% end %>

      <% if deployment.forced? %>
        <p class="mt-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-pill bg-warning-tint px-2 py-0.5 text-2xs font-medium text-warning">
          forced past preflight
        </p>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="shrink-0 text-right">
    <div class="font-mono text-2xs text-faint">
      <%= deployment.created_at.strftime("%b %d, %H:%M") %>
      <% if deployment.formatted_duration.present? %> · <%= deployment.formatted_duration %><% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono text-2xs text-faint"><%= deployment.user&.email || "system" %></div>
    <div class="mt-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-2">
      <% if app.kamal? && deployment.rollback_target? %>
        <%= rui_button_to("Rollback", rollback_deployment_path(deployment), method: :post, variant: :link, size: :sm, color: :warning,
              data: { turbo_confirm: "Roll #{app.name} back to release #{deployment.target_version&.first(12)}? This boots the previous image on the host (no rebuild)." }) %>
      <% end %>
      <%= rui_button("View", url: deployment_path(deployment), variant: :link, size: :sm, color: :slate) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
